# 8x10 seated character seen from BEHIND — the desk pose for a back-turned seat
# (`layout.desk_facings`), and the fallback for every seated pose whose own back
# view the pack does not ship.
#
# Two rows carry SKIN on purpose: the nape at row 5 and the hands at row 9.
# The first revision was six solid rows of hair over four of shirt, and it read
# as a BALL rather than a person — the front view spends only 2 rows on hair and
# 4 on a face, so the two silhouettes had nothing in common at a glance. Worse,
# it left skin at ZERO: per-agent identity is hair + skin (`agent_id`-seeded)
# while the outfit is cwd-seeded and therefore SHARED across a repo's agents, so
# a room of back-turned workers from one project became indistinguishable. The
# nape and hands put that axis back without inventing a face we cannot see.
#
# Hands sit exactly where `seated.sprite` puts them (row 9, both edges), so the
# front and back views read as the same person at the same desk.
@frame 0
. n H H H H n .
n H H H H H H n
H H H H H H H H
H H H H H H H H
. H H H H H H .
. . n S S n . .
. B B B B B B .
B B B B B B B B
B B B B B B B B
. S B B B B S .
